{"series":{"id":"spirit-realm-walker","slug":"spirit-realm-walker","title":"Spirit Realm Walker","image":"https://donghualife.com/uploads/images/1788469699114_1000611082.jpg","synopsis":"Zhang Yuanqing recibe accidentalmente una misteriosa carta negra que lo lleva a los Reinos Espirituales, un mundo sobrenatural lleno de peligros y extrañas pruebas. Tras superar su primera prueba, despierta como un Dios de la Noche y se convierte en un Caminante del Reino Espiritual. A partir de entonces, comienza a adentrarse en este mundo desconocido, enfrentándose a otros Caminantes y descubriendo poco a poco los secretos que se esconden tras los Reinos Espirituales. Autor: 卖报小郎君 (Mai Bao Xiao Lang Jun).","genres":["Sobrenatural","Misterio","Aventura","Acción"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/spirit-realm-walker","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:24.376Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"5273fa2e-ceb5-40ca-a116-ba6199f4c99f-temporada-1","slug":"5273fa2e-ceb5-40ca-a116-ba6199f4c99f-temporada-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/5273fa2e-ceb5-40ca-a116-ba6199f4c99f-temporada-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"spirit-realm-walker","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/5273fa2e-ceb5-40ca-a116-ba6199f4c99f-temporada-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:29.372Z","episodeCount":9,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":9,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"5273fa2e-ceb5-40ca-a116-ba6199f4c99f-temporada-1-1","slug":"5273fa2e-ceb5-40ca-a116-ba6199f4c99f-temporada-1-1","title":"Spirit Realm Walker — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/5273fa2e-ceb5-40ca-a116-ba6199f4c99f-temporada-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/5273fa2e-ceb5-40ca-a116-ba6199f4c99f-temporada-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:24.931Z","seriesId":"spirit-realm-walker","seasonId":"5273fa2e-ceb5-40ca-a116-ba6199f4c99f-temporada-1","number":1,"releaseDate":null},{"id":"5273fa2e-ceb5-40ca-a116-